flowchart LR
  shell["PowerShell + Bicep source"]
  arm["Azure Resource Manager"]
  group["Run-owned resource group"]
  storage["Hardened StorageV2 account"]
  identity["User-assigned managed identity"]
  journal["What-if / outputs / manifest"]
  shell -->|compile / what-if / deploy| arm
  arm -->|explicit subscription + scope| group
  group -->|declared storage resource| storage
  group -->|declared RG identity| identity
  arm -->|deployment outputs| journal
  storage -->|security property reads| journal
  identity -->|principal / ownership reads| journal
